Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 18:34:38 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 01/10] feat(qti-accesscontrol): add xpu4 hardware driver

Introduce the XPU4 driver (xpu4.c, xpu4_hal.c, xpu4_isr.c) alongside its headers (xpu4.h, xpu4_hal.h, xpu4_hwio.h). Unlike XPU3, whose configuration is compiled in from cfg/${CHIPSET}, XPU4 reads every
  table at runtime from an access-control config image supplied by an earlier boot stage.

